{"id":"adorable","lemma":"adorable","pos":"adj","rank":1686,"glosses":["adorable","lovable, loveable, cuddly, cute, sweet, dear, endearing"],"ipa":"/adoˈɾable/","forms":{"femininePlural":"adorables"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-adorable.wav","examples":[{"text":"El gato es adorable.","en":"The cat is adorable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35309"},{"text":"Los erizos son adorables.","en":"Hedgehogs are cute.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636779"},{"text":"Es verdaderamente una chica adorable.","en":"She is, indeed, a lovely girl.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735455"},{"text":"Tienes unos adorables ojos, ¿no es así?","en":"You have lovely eyes, don't you?"},{"text":"Ellos admiraban el adorable panorama.","en":"They admired the lovely scenery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506262"}]}